@startuml
title Provider 优雅停机与服务下线

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "JVM / Spring" as Lifecycle
participant "DubboShutdownHook" as Hook
participant "Registry" as Registry
participant "Consumer RegistryDirectory" as Directory
participant "RegistryProtocol" as RegistryProtocol
participant "DubboProtocol" as DubboProtocol
participant "HeaderExchangeServer" as Server
participant "Consumer Channel" as Consumer

Lifecycle -> Hook: run() / destroyAll()
Hook -> Registry: AbstractRegistryFactory.destroyAll()
Registry -> Registry: unregister(dynamic Provider URL)
Registry --> Directory: Provider 地址删除通知
Directory -> Directory: refreshInvoker() 移除 Invoker
Hook -> DubboProtocol: destroy()
DubboProtocol -> Server: close(shutdownTimeout)
Server -> Server: startClose()
Server -> Consumer: 发送 readonly event
Consumer -> Consumer: 标记 Channel 为 readonly\nDubboInvoker 不再 available
Server -> Server: 在超时窗口内等待连接结束
Server -> Server: 关闭 server、channel 和线程池
Hook -> RegistryProtocol: destroy()
RegistryProtocol -> RegistryProtocol: DestroyableExporter#unexport()
RegistryProtocol -> Registry: unregister / unsubscribe
RegistryProtocol -> RegistryProtocol: 异步等待 shutdown timeout\n再执行内部 exporter.unexport()

note over RegistryProtocol,Server
全局 Hook 先销毁 Registry，再逐个 destroy 已加载 Protocol。
RegistryProtocol 的异步等待不是 DubboProtocol 关闭前的严格屏障；
2.6.12 也不按正在执行的请求数做精确 drain。
end note
@enduml
